AUDE.md??蹂몃Ц???ㅻ쫭?덈떎. ${REMEDIATION}`,\r\n  ).toBe(true)\r\n\r\n  const agentsHeader = agents.slice(0, agents.length - claudeBody.length)\r\n  const headerLines = agentsHeader.split('\\n')\r\n  const noticeLines = headerLines.slice(2, -1)\r\n\r\n  expect(\r\n    headerLines[0],\r\n    `AGENTS.md ?쒕ぉ??CLAUDE.md ?쒕ぉ怨??ㅻ쫭?덈떎. ${REMEDIATION}`,\r\n  ).toBe(claudeTitle)\r\n  expect(\r\n    headerLines[1],\r\n    `AGENTS.md ?쒕ぉ怨??щ낯 怨좎? ?ъ씠??鍮?以꾩씠 ?놁뒿?덈떎. ${REMEDIATION}`,\r\n  ).toBe('')\r\n  expect(\r\n    headerLines.at(-1),\r\n    `AGENTS.md ?щ낯 怨좎?? 蹂몃Ц ?ъ씠??鍮?以꾩씠 ?놁뒿?덈떎. ${REMEDIATION}`,\r\n  ).toBe('')\r\n  expect(\r\n    noticeLines.length,\r\n    `AGENTS.md???щ낯 怨좎?媛 ?놁뒿?덈떎. ${REMEDIATION}`,\r\n  ).toBeGreaterThan(0)\r\n  expect(\r\n    noticeLines.every((line) => line.startsWith('> ')),\r\n    `AGENTS.md ?щ낯 怨좎?媛 Markdown ?몄슜臾?洹쒖빟???곕Ⅴ吏 ?딆뒿?덈떎. ${REMEDIATION}`,\r\n  ).toBe(true)\r\n  expect(\r\n    noticeLines.join('\\n'),\r\n    `AGENTS.md ?щ낯 怨좎?媛 CLAUDE.md瑜?媛由ы궎吏 ?딆뒿?덈떎. ${REMEDIATION}`,\r\n  ).toContain('`CLAUDE.md`')\r\n  expect(\r\n    noticeLines.join('\\n'),\r\n    `AGENTS.md ?ㅻ뜑媛 ?щ낯?꾩쓣 怨좎??섏? ?딆뒿?덈떎. ${REMEDIATION}`,\r\n  ).toContain('?щ낯')\r\n})\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
